iction or death and how many  we  take for us to be responsible for a  nuisance a public nuisance  despite settlements with other drug  companies the Oklahoma Attorney General  says there are currently no settlement  talks with Johnson &amp; Johnson this trial  is expected to last two months  Anthony two months Wow all Mar thanks a  lot of people watching that trial very  closely
 

